	(text "16bit * 48000Hz = 768,000b/s = 0.768Mb/s\n128Mb / 0.768Mb/s = 166.66 seconds (IS42S16800J-7xL)\n256Mb / 0.768Mb/s = 333.33 seconds (IS42S16160J-7xLI)\n512Mb / 0.768Mb/s = 666.66 seconds (IS42S16320F-7xLI)"
